statné jméno","tr":"isim","es":"sustantivo"}},{"w":"boredom","d":"The state of feeling weary and restless through lack of interest.","t":{"ru":"скука, тоска","nl":"verveling, saaiheid","pl":"nuda, znudzenie, znużenie","de":"Langeweile","fr":"ennui","it":"noia, tedio","cs":"nuda, znužení","tr":"can sıkıntısı, usanç, bunaltı","es":"aburrimiento, tedio, hastío"}},{"w":"interest","d":"The feeling of wanting to know or learn about something or someone.","t":{"ru":"интере́с","nl":"belangstelling, interesse","pl":"zainteresowanie","de":"Interesse","fr":"intérêt","it":"interesse, attenzione","cs":"zájem","tr":"ilgi, alaka","es":"interés"}},{"w":"excitement","d":"The state of feeling very happy, enthusiastic, or eager.","t":{"ru":"волнение, восторг, азарт, воодушевление","nl":"opgewondenheid, enthousiasme, spanning","pl":"ekscytacja, podekscytowanie, podniecenie","de":"Aufregung, Begeisterung, Vorfreude","fr":"enthousiasme, excitation, effervescence","it":"entusiasmo, eccitazione, fermento","cs":"vzrušení, nadšení, rozechvění","tr":"heyecan, coşku, heves","es":"entusiasmo, emoción, excitación"}},{"w":"anxiety","d":"An unpleasant state of mental uneasiness, nervousness, or concern about an uncertain event or outcome.","t":{"ru":"тревога, беспокойство, волнение","nl":"angst, bezorgdheid, onrust","pl":"niepokój, lęk, obawa","de":"Angst, Unruhe, Nervosität, Besorgnis","fr":"anxiété, inquiétude","it":"ansia, inquietudine, preoccupazione","cs":"úzkost, starost, neklid","tr":"kaygı, endişe","es":"ansiedad, zozobra, inquietud"}},{"w":"worry","d":"A strong feeling of anxiety or unhappiness caused by problems or fear of the unknown","t":{"ru":"беспокойство, тревога, волнение","nl":"zorg, angst","pl":"zmartwienie, niepokój","de":"Sorge, Angst","fr":"inquiétude, souci, angoisse","it":"preoccupazione, ansia","cs":"starost, úzkost","tr":"endişe, kaygı, tasa","es":"preocupación, zozobra, desasosiego"},"c":{"ru":"существительное","nl":"zelfstandig naamwoord","pl":"rzeczownik","de":"Substantiv","fr":"nom","it":"sostantivo","cs":"podstatné jméno","tr":"isim","es":"sustantivo"}},{"w":"stress","d":"Emotional pressure suffered by a human being or other animal.","t":{"ru":"стресс, напряжение","nl":"stress, spanning","pl":"stres, napięcie","de":"Stress, Anspannung","fr":"stress, tension","it":"stress, tensione","cs":"stres, napětí","tr":"stres, gerginlik","es":"estrés, tensión"}},{"w":"shame","d":"An uncomfortable or painful feeling of guilt, embarrassment, or disgrace caused by the consciousness of one's own wrong behavior or foolishness.","t":{"ru":"стыд, срам","nl":"schaamte, schande","pl":"wstyd, hańba","de":"Scham, Schande","fr":"honte","it":"vergogna","cs":"stud, hanba","tr":"utanç, mahcubiyet","es":"vergüenza"}},{"w":"guilt","d":"A feeling of worry or unhappiness that you have because you have done something wrong.","t":{"ru":"чувство вины, вина","nl":"schuldgevoel, wroeging","pl":"poczucie winy, wyrzuty sumienia","de":"Schuldgefühl, Schuld","fr":"culpabilité, sentiment de culpabilité, remords","it":"senso di colpa, rimorso","cs":"vina, pocit viny, výčitky svědomí","tr":"suçluluk duygusu, vicdan azabı","es":"culpa, remordimiento"}},{"w":"pride","d":"A feeling of deep pleasure or satisfaction derived from one's own achievements, qualities, or possessions, or those of someone closely associated with oneself.","t":{"ru":"гордость","nl":"trots","pl":"duma","de":"Stolz","fr":"fierté","it":"orgoglio","cs":"hrdost","tr":"gurur, kıvanç","es":"orgullo"}},{"w":"envy","d":"The unhappy feeling of wanting something that someone else has.","t":{"ru":"зависть","nl":"afgunst, nijd","pl":"zazdrość, zawiść","de":"Neid","fr":"envie, jalousie","it":"invidia","cs":"závist","tr":"kıskançlık, haset","es":"envidia, dentera"},"c":{"ru":"существительное","nl":"zelfstandig naamwoord","pl":"rzeczownik","de":"Substantiv","fr":"nom","it":"sostantivo","cs":"podstatné jméno","tr":"isim","es":"sustantivo"}},{"w":"jealousy","d":"A feeling of unhappiness and anger because you think someone you love likes another person, or because someone has something that you want.","t":{"ru":"ре́вность, за́висть","nl":"jaloezie, afgunst","pl":"zazdrość, zawiść","de":"Eifersucht, Neid","fr":"jalousie, envie","it":"gelosia, invidia","cs":"žárlivost, závist","tr":"kıskançlık, haset","es":"celos, envidia"}},{"w":"hope","d":"A feeling of expectation and desire for a certain thing to happen.","t":{"ru":"наде́жда","nl":"hoop","pl":"nadzieja","de":"Hoffnung","fr":"espoir, espérance","it":"speranza","cs":"naděje","tr":"umut, ümit","es":"esperanza"},"c":{"ru":"существительное","nl":"zelfstandig naamwoord","pl":"rzeczownik","de":"Substantiv","fr":"nom","it":"sostantivo","cs":"podstatné jméno","tr":"isim","es":"sustantivo"}},{"w":"disappointment","d":"The feeling of sadness or frustration when hopes or expectations are not met.","t":{"ru":"разочарова́ние","nl":"teleurstelling","pl":"rozczarowanie, zawód","de":"Enttäuschung","fr":"déception","it":"delusione, disappunto","cs":"zklamání","tr":"hayal kırıklığı, düş kırıklığı","es":"decepción, desilusión, desencanto"}},{"w":"loneliness","d":"A feeling of sadness or depression resulting from being alone or having no companions.","t":{"ru":"одиночество, тоска","nl":"eenzaamheid","pl":"samotność","de":"Einsamkeit","fr":"solitude","it":"solitudine","cs":"osamělost","tr":"yalnızlık","es":"soledad"}},{"w":"grief","d":"Great sadness, especially caused by the death of someone you love or a significant personal loss.","t":{"ru":"горе, скорбь, печаль","nl":"verdriet, rouw, smart","pl":"smutek, żal","de":"Trauer, Kummer, Gram","fr":"chagrin, douleur, peine","it":"dolore, sofferenza","cs":"žal, smutek, zármutek","tr":"keder, yas, hüzün","es":"dolor, pesar, duelo"}},{"w":"disgust","d":"An intense feeling of strong dislike, revulsion, or loathing caused by something unpleasant or offensive.","t":{"ru":"отвращение, омерзение","nl":"afschuw, walging, weerzin","pl":"odraza, wstręt","de":"Ekel, Widerwille","fr":"dégoût, répugnance, écœurement",